{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14779","headline":"达奚中丞东斋壁画山水各赋一物得树杪悬泉送长安赵元阳少府 · 卢纶","name":"达奚中丞东斋壁画山水各赋一物得树杪悬泉送长安赵元阳少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素壁画飞泉，从云落树颠。\n练垂疑叶响，云幷觉枝偏。\n利物得双劒，爲儒当一贤。\n应思洒尘陌，调膳亦芳鲜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}